---
/*
  The handoff page. One card, one offer: what Grab Your Bibles is, the study
  that is open, one button across. The observe instructions live on the study
  site's How page — never here. This page NEVER lists sessions and NEVER
  republishes study content; canonical stays on grabyourbibles.com.
*/
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Signup from '../components/Signup.astro';
import home from '../data/home.json';
import site from '../data/site.json';

const STUDY_SITE = 'https://grabyourbibles.com';
---
<Base
  title={`Studies · ${site.name}`}
  description="Guided Bible studies you can walk through on your own or with a group."
>
  <section class="band shell">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h1>Studies</h1>
      <span class="label">grabyourbibles.com</span>
    </div>

    <p class="art-dek" style="margin-bottom:1.4rem">
      The studies live on their own site, because they are a different kind of thing than
      an essay. An essay is me working an idea out in writing. A study is you with your
      Bible open, marking the text yourself, on your own or with a room full of people.
    </p>

    <div class="studies-card reveal">
      <div class="studies-body">
        <h2>{home.studiesHeading}</h2>
        <p class="dek" set:html={home.studiesDek}></p>

        <hr class="studies-rule" />

        <span class="st-kicker">Now open &middot; The Book of Ruth</span>
        <h3 class="st-title">God&rsquo;s Presence in Every Season</h3>
        <p class="st-dek">
          Seven sessions in the book of Ruth. God never speaks out loud in Ruth &mdash; and He
          never stops working. Learn to be rooted deeply enough to see it.
        </p>
        <p class="st-meta">7 sessions &middot; on your own or with a group</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href={STUDY_SITE} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          {home.studiesCta} <span aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="studies-aside" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="studies-mark">Grab<br />Your<br />Bibles</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Signup />
</Base>
